// ================================
// PUNTO 1: Comprobar Rutas
// ================================

### Root / no Auth: Login
GET http://localhost:3000/

### Root / with Auth: Home
GET http://localhost:3000/
x-auth: test

### Home / with Auth: Home
GET http://localhost:3000/home.html
x-auth: test

### Tasks / with Auth: Tasks
GET http://localhost:3000/tasks.html
x-auth: test

// ================================
// PUNTO 2: GET Users
// ================================

// Get all users
### 
GET http://localhost:3000/users?page=1&limit=3
x-auth: admin_auth

// ================================
// PUNTO 3: POST 3 Users + Check Tasks/Tags
// ================================

### Create Users
POST http://localhost:3000/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Kim Dokja",
    "email": "kim_dokja@kimcom.com",
    "password": "yjhs-apologist",
    "confirm_password": "yjhs-apologist"
}

### Create Users
POST http://localhost:3000/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Yoo Joonghyuk",
    "email": "yoo_joonghyuk@kimcom.com",
    "password": "supreme-king",
    "confirm_password": "supreme-king"
}

### Create Users
POST http://localhost:3000/users
Content-Type: application/json

